(label "NOR_IO3" (at 142.24 78.74 270) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "93e964d4-a9fc-4183-ad32-8e8437b7dede"))
(text "128Mbit Quad SPI NOR flash, 133 MHz, 2.7-3.6 V, 8-SOP 200 mil - MX25L12833FM2I-10G (alt W25Q128JVSIQ)\nLAYOUT: 100 nF + 1 uF at VCC (<=2 mm, 100 nF closest), short via to GND plane. Solid GND reference under all SPI traces, no plane splits.\nCLK: 27R source termination within 5 mm of host pin; route CLK first, shortest, >=3W spacing to other nets; no stubs/test points mid-trace.\nQSPI: length-match IO0-IO3 to CLK within +/-2.5 mm (>=80 MHz), keep total length < 50 mm. 0R on IO lines = termination provision (fit 27R after scope/TDR check).\nWP#/IO2 and HOLD#/IO3 10k pull-ups are required when the host runs 1-1-1 or 1-1-2 modes (and during boot before QE is set).\nTypical use: MCU XIP / boot flash, second source to W25Q128. Rename CS# / CLK / IO labels to your nets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "92569fb7-d6ac-4445-9fd0-8338735693dc"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
